// ansi_str(): referenced throughout cmds/mortal/_look.lpc, _glance.lpc, _spy.lpc
// and a couple of monster files, but the simul_efun that implements it was
// missing from this archive entirely (not present anywhere in the source
// tree). This driver already auto-translates "%^COLOR%^" markup to real
// ANSI escapes at the write()/tell_object()/more() layer, so the original
// implementation (on whatever driver this mudlib was last run on) most
// likely just normalized/passed through an already-color-tagged string.
// Provide a safe passthrough so callers compile and keep working exactly
// as if color processing happens at the usual output layer.
string ansi_str(string str)
{
    return str;
}
